    Limitations = @(
        'The historical ApiRef stays unchanged. ReauditedCommandFields records demonstrated parameter changes separately from the route delta.'
        'Offline fixtures verify client contracts, not live authorization, persistence, or transaction behavior.'
        'No admin request approve, fulfill or cancel REST endpoint is routed. Self-service mutations fix quantity to 1 and do not accept dates or notes. No accessory or model request mutation is routed.'
        'Dashboard count fields are permission-dependent and omitted, not zero. Location assets_count and assigned_assets_count differ. Sort fields are permission-dependent; the server may fall back to name.'
        'Calendar has no offset paging. total is counted before per-row checks; truncated means the raw query hit its limit, not that more authorized events are guaranteed.'
        'Low stock uses site alert_threshold and per-type view permissions. No client threshold, date or type filter exists.'
        'Restore needs model delete permission and can return domain errors with HTTP 200.'
        'Logout revokes only the current Passport access token and linked refresh tokens. Empty 204 emits nothing; empty 401 remains an error. No automatic local disconnect or OIDC revocation.'
        'Maintenance color preservation adds a view permission requirement and a non-atomic GET/PATCH pair. Explicit bound color bypasses the lookup.'
        'Import preservation follows PHP empty semantics, including 0, false and string 0, and must be resent on each slice.'
        'PreserveResponse bypasses normalization and pagination. Combining it with all returns the first envelope only.'
        'The shared transport overwrites body StatusCode with actual HTTP status on error envelopes; body status cannot conceal HTTP errors.'
    )
